+
+// MGJ (b1789, MGP arm J, owner idea via the CI Analyser, spec_mgp_1109 / spec_mgp_armj_1110): Marcella joins a mate's capture the round
+// before it pays (a mate arriving then takes a full share with no restart, interactions.md capture; each gem she banks pays 2 gold,
+// GameRules:658). Runtime data flag MGJ_TAB[1], read first; 0 = off. Bit 1: on a calm turn (errand stage), when one of our captures pays
+// at the next round start (ally capturing, timer 1), exactly one ally stands on its region and is not a Prism with gems, a free region
+// tile is one step away, the reward is >= 20 gold or 6 gems, no foe is seen within 6, my HP >= 50%, I am not channelling or stunned and
+// not on a tribute tile with a bag >= 10: step onto it and end the turn. Bit 2 (J2, its own cell): the same from two rounds before
+// payment (timer 2) with the tile within two steps (one step toward it now, onto it at timer 1).
+// Both: never when I stand on a region (MGJ-A, GameRules:196), beside any Prism, when the holder has Prospector and I do not (MGJ-B,
+// GameRules:297), or with a foe remembered within 3 rounds near me.
+#define MGJ_BITS 0
+inline const volatile int MGJ_TAB[2] = { 0x4D474A31, MGJ_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define MGJ_ON(b) ((MGJ_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
